<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11136" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀόρᾱ-τος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>unseen, invisible,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phd.</u>
				85e
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀόρατος ὄψιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alex.
					240.5
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τραῦμ᾽ ἀ., ἔρως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>APl.</u>
					4.198
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Maec.
			</span></i>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τὸ μέλλον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Isoc.
					1.29
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἀόρατον</span>
			<i>the unseen world, the unseen,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξ οὐρανοῦ καὶ τοῦ ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Sph.</u>
					246a
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Tht.</u>
				155e
			</span></i>, al.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰν ἀ. ἀτραπιτὸν βιότου</span>”
				<i>obscure,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Epigr.Gr.
					223
				</span></i>
			 (Milet.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. κατὰ δόξαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ath.
					12.511d
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν ἀ. ὡς ὁρῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ep.Hebr.</u>
					11.27
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.157
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Placit.</u>
				2.24.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Act.
			, <i>not having seen, without experience of,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παντὸς κακοῦ, δεινοῦ,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				2.21.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				3.108.6
			</span></i>: abs., <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Halc.</u>
				3
			</span></i>.</div>
